  "body": "Release 0.14.0 (minor: feat PRs merged since v0.13.0).\n\n- `RELEASE_NOTES.md` for 0.14.0\n- `CHANGELOG.md`: one row per behaviour PR merged since v0.13.0 (42 rows), from each PR's Changelog line\n- `RECOMMENDED.md`: the 13 `docs/decisions/*.md` files gathered by `scripts/collect-decisions.ps1` (the files are removed; README stays)\n- Version bump to 0.14.0 and Cargo.lock sync (`scripts/release.ps1 -Version 0.14.0 -NoTag -Installer`)\n\nGate: the full release tier passed on this tree (release.ps1 phases 1-10 green); `dist/camcraft-0.14.0-win-x64.zip` built locally.\n\nAfter merge: tag the merge commit `v0.14.0` (after the empty-diff check against this branch's tip) and push the tag, which runs release.yml.\n\nChangelog: none (release mechanics)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
